{"version":1,"content":"<p>華為與江淮汽車聯合打造的高端新能源車「尊界V800」爆出煞車踏板支架斷裂風波，事件持續發酵。</p><p>新華社周四（15日）報道，工信部、中央網信辦、市場監管總局高度重視，在前期調查工作基礎上，成立聯合調查組開展核查，並依法依規處理，結果將及時公布。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T16:39:04.564830+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T16:00:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T20:37:37.184722+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T16:37:35.539765+00:00","content_hash":"632b47a4e49a15318760ba0257fb7f4d96bb212e000757f7b96a09df007151b3","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}